{"base_urReads th\u003cidx\u003e` / `${logicalId}:r\u003cidx\u003e` targets one tab, while bare `c\u003cidx\u003e` / `r\u003cidx\u003e` address"id":"docs.sheet.get","method":"GET","parameters":[{"in":"path","name":"docId","required":true,"type":"string"},{"description":"max cells per page; opts into paged reads. Bounded by the server byte cap regardless. Omit for a whole-sheet read.","in":"query","name":"limit","type":"integer"},{"description":"opaque nextCursor from the previous page; also opts into paged reads. New compact cursors bind the document and selected worksheet; cursor-only continuation preserves that scope. Repeating an equivalent selector is allowed, changing scope is rejected. A cursor whose snapshot moved returns 409 sheet_changed.","in":"query","name":"cursor","type":"string"},{"description":"read only this persistent worksheet logicalId, discovered via docs sheet list. Mutually exclusive with --sheet-name. Filters cells and associated metadata before pagination and byte limits. Omit both selectors for the whole workbook. Requires worksheet-scoped read backend support.","flag_name":"sheet-id","in":"query","max_length":64,"min_length":1,"name":"sheetId","type":"string"},{"description":"read only the worksheet with this exact display name. Mutually exclusive with --sheet-id. Missing names return sheet_not_found; duplicates return ambiguous_sheet_name with candidate IDs. Never guesses or falls back to all worksheets.","flag_name":"sheet-name","in":"query","min_length":1,"name":"sheetName","type":"string"}],"path":"/v1/bot/docs/{docId}/sheet","response_schema":{"properties":{"baseVersion":{"description":"opaque base64 base-version token; pass to `docs sheet edit --base-version`","type":"string"},"docId":{"type":"string"},"hasMore":{"description":"paged mode: more cells remain after this page","type":"boolean"},"nextCursor":{"description":"paged mode: opaque cursor for the next page (null when hasMore is false); pass back via --cursor","nullable":true,"t